\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Sing we the King who is coming to reign,
\par Glory to Jesus, the Lamb that was slain,
\par Life and salvation His empire shall bring,
\par Joy to the nations when Jesus is King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Come let us sing: Praise to our King,
\par Jesus our King, Jesus our King:
\par This is our song, who to Jesus belong:
\par Glory to Jesus, to Jesus our King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. All men shall dwell in His marvellous light,
\par Races long severed His love shall unite,
\par Justice and truth from His sceptre shall spring,
\par Wrong shall be ended when Jesus is King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Come let us sing: Praise to our King,
\par Jesus our King, Jesus our King:
\par This is our song, who to Jesus belong:
\par Glory to Jesus, to Jesus our King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. All shall be well in His kingdom of peace,
\par Freedom shall flourish and wisdom increase,
\par Foe shall be friend when His triumph we sing,
\par Sword shall be sickle when Jesus is King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Come let us sing: Praise to our King,
\par Jesus our King, Jesus our King:
\par This is our song, who to Jesus belong:
\par Glory to Jesus, to Jesus our King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Souls shall be saved from the burden of sin,
\par Doubt shall not darken His witness within,
\par Hell hath no terrors, and death hath no sting;
\par Love is victorious when Jesus is King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Come let us sing: Praise to our King,
\par Jesus our King, Jesus our King:
\par This is our song, who to Jesus belong:
\par Glory to Jesus, to Jesus our King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Kingdom of Christ, for thy coming we pray,
\par Hasten, O Father, the dawn of the day
\par When this new song Thy creation shall sing,
\par Satan is vanquished and Jesus is King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Come let us sing: Praise to our King,
\par Jesus our King, Jesus our King:
\par This is our song, who to Jesus belong:
\par Glory to Jesus, to Jesus our King.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

